# Task Breakdown

Use this directory for detailed work-breakdown artifacts that are too large or too structured for `TASK_STACK.md`.

## Recommended naming

- `TASK-*`
- `task-breakdown-*`
- `slice-*`
- `backlog-*`

## Each artifact should make clear

- work slices
- dependencies
- owner and status
- linkage to iteration or request artifacts

